From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josef Holzmayr <jester@theyoctojester.info>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 06:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] imx93_11x11_evk: Enable Mender configuration

Enable redundant environment storage in MMC and the bootcount framework
so meta-mender can install its bootloader environment and perform safe
A/B updates with rollback on the i.MX 93 11x11 LPDDR4X EVK.

The environment grows from 16 KiB to 128 KiB because Mender's default
environment adds a substantial number of variables.

The two offsets are not free choices. meta-mender derives
MENDER_UBOOT_ENV_STORAGE_DEVICE_OFFSET_1 and _2 from
MENDER_UBOOT_ENV_STORAGE_DEVICE_OFFSET (which must be a multiple of
MENDER_PARTITION_ALIGNMENT) and uses them in three places that all have
to agree: the raw uboot.env region in the disk image, /etc/fw_env.config
in the rootfs, and U-Boot's own CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET. With the defaults for
this board, 8 MiB alignment and a 128 KiB environment, that is 0x800000
and 0x1000000. Changing one of them without the others produces a board
that boots but where mender-update's fw_setenv writes somewhere U-Boot
never reads, so A/B silently never happens. u-boot-mender.inc's
do_configure sanity check catches a mismatch on the U-Boot side.

CONFIG_SYS_MMC_ENV_DEV is already 1, the microSD slot, and is left alone.

Targets NXP downstream u-boot-imx lf_v2025.04 as packaged by
meta-freescale for the wrynose release.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Mender configuration]

Signed-off-by: Josef Holzmayr <jester@theyoctojester.info>
---
 configs/imx93_11x11_evk_defconfig | 9 ++++++---
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/configs/imx93_11x11_evk_defconfig b/configs/imx93_11x11_evk_defconfig
--- a/configs/imx93_11x11_evk_defconfig
+++ b/configs/imx93_11x11_evk_defconfig
@@ -7,8 +7,8 @@ CONFIG_SPL_LIBCOMMON_SUPPORT=y
 CONFIG_SPL_LIBGENERIC_SUPPORT=y
 CONFIG_NR_DRAM_BANKS=2
 CONFIG_SF_DEFAULT_SPEED=40000000
-CONFIG_ENV_SIZE=0x4000
-CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET=0x700000
+CONFIG_ENV_SIZE=0x20000
+CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET=0x800000
 CONFIG_DM_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE="freescale/imx93-11x11-evk"
 CONFIG_USB_TCPC=y
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ CONFIG_SPL_BSS_START_ADDR=0x2051a000
 CONFIG_SPL_BSS_MAX_SIZE=0x2000
 CONFIG_SYS_LOAD_ADDR=0x80400000
 CONFIG_SPL=y
+CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET_REDUND=0x1000000
 CONFIG_CMD_DEKBLOB=y
 CONFIG_SPL_IMX_ROMAPI_LOADADDR=0x88000000
 CONFIG_SYS_MEMTEST_START=0x80000000
@@ -84,8 +85,8 @@ CONFIG_CMD_EXT4_WRITE=y
 CONFIG_OF_CONTROL=y
 CONFIG_SPL_OF_CONTROL=y
 CONFIG_ENV_OVERWRITE=y
-CONFIG_ENV_IS_NOWHERE=y
 CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_MMC=y
+CONFIG_SYS_REDUNDAND_ENVIRONMENT=y
 CONFIG_SYS_RELOC_GD_ENV_ADDR=y
 CONFIG_SYS_MMC_ENV_DEV=1
 CONFIG_USE_ETHPRIME=y
@@ -95,6 +96,8 @@ CONFIG_SPL_DM=y
 CONFIG_SYSCON=y
 CONFIG_ADC=y
 CONFIG_ADC_IMX93=y
+CONFIG_BOOTCOUNT_LIMIT=y
+CONFIG_BOOTCOUNT_ENV=y
 CONFIG_SPL_CLK_IMX93=y
 CONFIG_CLK_IMX93=y
 CONFIG_CPU=y
--
2.43.0

